# Requests for the IntelliJ HTTP Client against the local environment (docker compose up --build --wait).
# Run "Token" first: it stores the access token for the requests below. Demo clients: partner-a (tenant-a, read and
# write), partner-a-readonly (tenant-a, read), partner-b (tenant-b, read and write).

@api = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@oauth = http://localhost:8090/netia

### Token for partner-a
POST {{oauth}}/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=partner-a&client_secret=any

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.access_token);
%}

### Create a trouble ticket: the request example of the contract. Sent again, it returns 200 with the same ticket.
POST {{api}}/troubleTicket
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalId": "OK-123456",
  "serviceId": 987654321,
  "description": "Brak transmisji danych dla usługi klienta.",
  "status": "new",
  "note": "Zgłoszenie utworzone przez konto API partnera."
}

> {%
    client.global.set("ticketId", response.body.id);
%}

### List the trouble tickets of the tenant
GET {{api}}/troubleTicket
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get the trouble ticket
GET {{api}}/troubleTicket/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a note
POST {{api}}/troubleTicket/{{ticketId}}/note
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Klient prosi o potwierdzenie planowanego terminu zamknięcia."
}

### Close the trouble ticket; closing it again returns 200 without changes
PATCH {{api}}/troubleTicket/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "closed"
}

### 400 VALIDATION_ERROR: create accepts only the status "new"
POST {{api}}/troubleTicket
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalId": "OK-123457",
  "serviceId": 987654321,
  "description": "Niestabilne parametry usługi.",
  "status": "acknowledged",
  "note": "Zgłoszenie utworzone przez konto API partnera."
}

### 404 SERVICE_NOT_FOUND: service 987654331 belongs to tenant-b
POST {{api}}/troubleTicket
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalId": "OK-123458",
  "serviceId": 987654331,
  "description": "Brak transmisji danych dla usługi klienta.",
  "status": "new",
  "note": "Zgłoszenie utworzone przez konto API partnera."
}

### 401 UNAUTHORIZED: no token
GET {{api}}/troubleTicket
